{"unit_id":"tag:0A3T:proof","translation":"由定理<REF_0001>（关于集合（sets）的层（sheaves）），有\n<MATH_0001>\n，其中<MATH_0002>为投影（projection）。由于严格 Hensel（strictly henselian）局部环（local ring）<MATH_0003>的剩余域（residue field）为<MATH_0004>，由引理之前的讨论和引理<REF_0002>得到结论。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"strictly henselian","target_term":"严格 Hensel"},{"source_term":"local ring","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"residue field","target_term":"剩余域"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"strictly henselian","target_term":"严格 Hensel","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"local ring","target_term":"局部环","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"residue field","target_term":"剩余域","context":"词表尚未批准"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0A3U:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的固有态射（proper morphism）。设<MATH_0002>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。置<MATH_0003>，其投影（projections）为<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>。设<MATH_0006>为<MATH_0007>上的任意层（sheaf）。则<MATH_0008>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"固有态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"projections","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"固有态射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"projections","target_term":"投影","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"词表尚未批准"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0A3U:proof","translation":"存在典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0001>。具体地，它伴随（adjoint）于映射（map）\n<MATH_0002>\n，后者是将<MATH_0003>应用于典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0004>\n所得。要检查此映射（map）为同构（isomorphism），可计算茎（stalks）上的情况。设<MATH_0005>为几何点（geometric point），其像（image）<MATH_0006>在<MATH_0007>中。由引理<REF_0001>，茎（stalks）分别为<MATH_0008>和<MATH_0009>。这里的层（sheaves）<MATH_0010>和<MATH_0011>为拉回（pullbacks），由<MATH_0012>沿投影（projections）<MATH_0013>和<MATH_0014>得到。由于<MATH_0015>作为概形（schemes）成立，可见茎（stalks）一致。我们省略此同构（isomorphism）与我们的映射（map）相容（compatible）的验证。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"pullbacks","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"projections","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"compatible","target_term":"相容"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"pullbacks","target_term":"拉回","contex