{"unit_id":"tag:095S:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n现在开始讨论固有基变换定理（proper base change theorem）。为此引入一些记号。考虑交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0001>\n，由概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）组成。于是得到景（sites）的交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0002>\n。对于任意对象（object）<MATH_0003>，它属于<MATH_0004>，得到典范（canonical）基变换（base change）映射（map）\n<MATH_0005>\n，它在<MATH_0006>中。见景上上同调（Cohomology on Sites）注记<REF_0001>，其中使用常值（constant）层（sheaf）<MATH_0007>作为环层（sheaf of rings）。在此公式中通常省略下标<MATH_0008>。例如，若<MATH_0009>，其中<MATH_0010>为阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），它在<MATH_0011>上，则基变换（base change）映射（map）为映射（map）\n<MATH_0012>\n，它在<MATH_0013>中。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n在上述一般性下，映射（map）（<REF_0002>）不可能为同构（isomorphism）。目标是证明它为同构（isomorphism），条件是图（diagram）（<REF_0003>）为笛卡尔（cartesian）的，<MATH_0014>固有（proper），<MATH_0015>的上同调层（cohomology sheaves）为挠（torsion）的，且<MATH_0016>下有界（bounded below）。为研究此问题，引入以下术语。称<TEXTITOPEN_0001>上同调与基变换交换于（cohomology commutes with base change for）<MATH_0017><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若（<REF_0004>）为同构（isomorphism），对每个图（diagram）（<REF_0005>），其中<MATH_0018>，以及每个挠（torsion）阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0019>均成立。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"proper base change theorem","target_term":"固有基变换定理"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上上同调"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaf of rings","target_term":"环层"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_te