{"unit_id":"tag:0A4B:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的固有态射（proper morphism）。以下条件等价（equivalent）\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>上同调（cohomology）与基变换（base change）交换（commutes），对于<MATH_0002>而言（见上文），\n<STRUCT_0003>对于每个素数（prime number）<MATH_0003>及每个内射（injective）的层（sheaf），其取值为<MATH_0004>-模（modules）<MATH_0005>，在<MATH_0006>上，以及每个图（diagram）（<REF_0001>），其中<MATH_0007>，层（sheaves）<MATH_0008>在<MATH_0009>时为零。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"固有态射"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"prime number","target_term":"素数"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"固有态射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"prime number","target_term":"素数","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"词表尚未批准"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0A4B:proof","translation":"显然 (1) 蕴含 (2)。反之，假设 (2)，设<MATH_0001>为挠（torsion）阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），它在<MATH_0002>上。设<MATH_0003>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism），并设<MATH_0004>，其投影（projections）为<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>，如图（diagram）（<REF_0001>）所示。我们要证明层（sheaves）的映射（maps）\n<MATH_0007>\n对所有<MATH_0008>均为同构（isomorphisms）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n对每个<MATH_0009>，令<MATH_0010>为截面（sections）的子层（subsheaf），取自<MATH_0011>且被<MATH_0012>零化（annihilated）。则<MATH_0013>。函子（functors）<MATH_0014>和<MATH_0015>与任意余极限（colimits）交换（commute）（作为左伴随（left adjoints））。取高阶直像（direct images），沿<MATH_0016>或<MATH_0017>，与滤过余极限（filtered colimits）交换（commutes），由引理<REF_0002>得到。因此可见\n<MATHSEG_0001>且<MATHSEG_0002>\n。故只需在<MATH_0018>被正整数（positive integer）<MATH_0019>零化（annihilated）时证明结论。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n若<MATH_0020>，对某个素数（prime number）<MATH_0021>成立，则得到短正合列（short exact sequence）\n<MATH_0022>\n。注意<MATH_0023>被<MATH_0024>零化（annihilated）。此外，若结论对<MATH_0025>和<MATH_0026>均成立，则由高阶直像（direct images）的长正合列（long exact sequence）（以及<MATH_0027>引理）得到结论。这样归约到<MATH_0028>被素数（prime number）<MATH_0029>零化（annihilated）的情形。\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\n假定<MATH_0030>被素数（prime number）<MATH_0031>零化（annihilated）。选取内射（injective）消解（resolution）<MATH_0032>，它在<MATH_0033>中。应用假设 (2) 及 Leray 的无环性引理（acyclicity lemma）（导出范畴（Derived Categories）引理<REF_0003>），可见\n<MATH_0034>\n计算<MATH_0035>。应用引理<REF_0004>得到结论。\n","allowed_english":["Leray"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"torsion","target_term":"挠"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"projections","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"subsheaf","target_term":"子层"},{"source_term":"annihilated","target_term":"零化"},{"source_term":"functors","target_te